Mathematicians define the natural numbers (0, 1, 2, …) with two basic ideas:

| Axiom | Description |
|------|--------------|
| **0 is a natural number.** | The starting point. |
| **Successor function S(n)** | For any number *n*, S(n) is the next number (e.g., S(0)=1,",2457.8
